# Pairs with TypeOK. The type invariant rejects a capture state outside the turn.
MODULE: CaptureEndsInUnknownState
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the capture turn ends in a state the turn does not have
PERTURBS: CaptureLinkReturns

--- FIND
    /\ ch[IF l = "B" THEN "capB" ELSE "capC"] \in {"done", "deferred"}
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "done"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[IF l = "B" THEN "capB" ELSE "capC"] \in {"done", "deferred"}
    \* MUTATION: an unknown capture state
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "returned"]
--- END
